        "text": "Your hatred for dried blood will cause your spearhead to rust and go dull."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Tonight will be the same as that night. There will be but a single moon in the lake."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "The reflection of the moonlight, weak and powerless, always hiding in the back... If only things had gone in a different direction..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "Ah... It's too quiet."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "The calmest nights are always the cruelest, for that is when those who should not have been forgotten are dragged to the surface of our memories."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "You must remember... I told you this before. We often rested at the campsite by the lake, sat around the campfire, and discussed how to deal with the beasts."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "The crackling, the turning barbecue, the melting fat. I remember."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "I... I will never forget any of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "It's time. Let's not keep the beast waiting any longer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau",
        "text": "Hm? A fire from that direction..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
