    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "The Terran night sky looks just about the same as ours... but the stars apurr to be in completely different pawsitions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "Mrow... So meowny strange clouds covering the sky tonight, like nothing I've ever seen. I should note this down."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "From what Noir Corne has told me, Terra's climate is not meowch different from ours."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "Wind, thunderstorms, rain, and snow... Similar environments have similar natural cycles. Nothing strange about that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "But he also mentioned a phenomeownon called... Catastrophes? What could be so cat-astrophic to deserve a name like that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "If his description is accurate, then they're as terrifying and destructive as the Amatsu turning out, only caused by this Originium they seem so obsessed with..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "How could rocks pawssibly be the cause of <i>anything</i> when they can't even move? I can't make heads or tails of how this works."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "Not that I'm one to acknowledge a phenomeownon I've never observed myself, but... it seems nearly everything unique about Terra has to do with Originium."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "Oh... If only I could see a Catastrophe with meow own eyes..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "Mrow? Is Noir Corne back?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "Huh? Who's that...?"
    },
